      "message": "something occurred to me: should we call this `InsecureCipherAlgoTripleDESCBC` (same for other insecure algorithms?). This follows the pattern from `InsecureIgnoreHostkey()`. \n\nWe didn\u0027t consider this in the proposal process, but maybe it\u0027s good to decide now before we set this in stone.\n\n@filippo@golang.org, @roland@golang.org",
